<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Sept palm oil exports 672,153t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Sept palm oil exports 672,153t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Monday said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for September at 672,153 tonnes against 708,601 tonnes in August.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 123,810 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 327,228 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 89,527 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 131,588 tonnes.  </p>
<p>India, which was the main buyer during the period, taking 159,276 tonnes, China at 80,665 tonnes, Pakistan at 56,130 tonnes and Japan at 44,545.</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 75,382 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
